Falsifies `rsext4::blockgroup_description::verification::group_descriptor_decode_is_total_and_stays_in_its_record`.

The defect: the record size check accepts any size from 32 bytes, so a record of 33 to 63
bytes is decoded as a 64-byte one.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(accepted)`, or the slice index of a field past the record.

